  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing the Small Arms Survey Strategy 2022 - 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding to the Small Arms Survey to implement the Small Arms Survey Strategy, including research and advocacy on arms control arrangements for Small Arms and Light Weapons. The Strategy guides the work of the Small Arms Survey in its global efforts to prevent and reduce illicit arms flows and armed violence in line with the
Sustainable Development Goals. Foci include stocks and flows of weapons and ammunition, impacts of illicit arms and armed violence, and measures and programmes that promote security.</narrative>
  </description>
